	a	encumbrance		  O	  examine/set options
	c	call object		  R	  remove ring
	d	drop object		  P	  put on ring
	e	eat food		  T	  take armor off
	q	quaff potion		  Q	  quit game
	r	read a scroll		  S	  save game
